{"v":4,"catch":"激烈的競爭已經到來。","desc":"《KNUCKLE HEADS》是NAMCO（Bandai Namco Entertainment Inc.）於1993年發行的格鬥遊戲。\n加入大逃殺“KNUCKLE HEADS”並贏得現金獎勵和聲譽。\n遊戲最多可由 4 名玩家同時玩。\n選擇6名非常獨特且強大的玩家之一併生存。\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2024-08-15","genres":["格鬥","街機"],"players":"單機 1–4 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":4,"poff":4,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/8ab52ba58cbf775a1a7f0602a7c41b3cc5567198a22ec56025fefc451428c297.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/42c0a005ccc897049c7b6bacc94a8d32d4c4101b1de1b4e5ed09bda1d9f3157e.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/27da30d9c5016a5357a9a0ad01912be263454116dbe9a8dfb82f614f45653df7.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/5d4bba890f2a627d477b5aa488603385b2ae3502197e3ad7625f394051dd2b67.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f88c7437e5ad922a9a53f3c18c3a833c14097338a7e465c017310ff159b78753.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/78aea293898c454e2cb739f3e336e1aad97f07bbfe5872b1584335f4d7a6b590.jpg"],"titleId":"0100a1b01e6aa000","dlc":[]}